# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
# Libraries should not include pubspec.lock, per https://dart.dev/guides/libraries/private-files#pubspeclock.
/pubspec.lock
**/doc/api/
.dart_tool/
build/

# Fetched native artifacts: the PlatformCDart.xcframework that the iOS podspec
# downloads from artifactory (see ios/fetch_platform_cdart.sh). Never commit
# or publish these - they are ~192 MB and are version-keyed by the podspec.
/ios/Frameworks/
